      "source": [
        "Next step is Indexing:\n",
        "This step includes creating chromadb client , creating collection , creating list of IDs, list of content and list of embeddings for all the points and insert in the collection.\n",
        "\n",
        "you can verify if the data is inserted by collection.get() method, However, collection doesnt return embeddings by default so one need to mention to include embeddings to retrieve them."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "PVSR16j0BNLe"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import chromadb\n",
        "\n",
        "# Create a new Chroma client\n",
        "\n",
        "client = chromadb.PersistentClient(path=\"/tmp/chromadb\")\n",
        "\n",
        "collection = client.get_or_create_collection(name = \"docs\")"
